          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The compounds formed in this manner by the transfer of electrons from a metal to a non-metal are known as ionic compounds or electrovalent compounds. Can you name the cation and anion present",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { M g C l } _ { 2 } ?"
            }
